      "writtenOn": "2024-05-21T06:40:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`ANDROID_KABI_RESERVED` is ONLY for changes that come in from -lts releases upstream, to handle any future abi issues.  If you know you want to backport features from upstream, that are NOT going to be in a -lts kernel release, then use the `ANDROID_BACKPORT_RESERVED` macro, as that is what it is for.\n\nSo use `ANDROID_BACKPORT_RESERVED` here please.",
      "parentUuid": "ddc4b8bc_eb767873",
